# Climatic Mysteries — unpack close-ups (locked)

## Approach

Click item name → **swap backdrop** to a **close-up PNG** in `assets/scenes/unpack_closeups/{id}.png`.

Close-ups must **match** `rental_unpack_scene.png` (same rug, wood, lamp light, illustrated style). Prefer **authored close-ups** that frame one item clearly; mask-crops from the wide scene are a fallback when props are too clustered.

**Do not** bring back CSS pan/zoom camera math on the wide room image.

## Regenerate mask-crops (fallback only)

After scene or mask changes, optional crop regen:

```bash
python3 climaticMysteries/scripts/build-unpack-closeups.py
```

Masks: `assets/scenes/unpack_masks/{id}.png`. Overwrites `unpack_closeups/` — only run if intentionally replacing authored art.

## Code touch points

- `UNPACK_OBJECTS[].closeup` — image key per item
- `focusUnpackItem` — `setPrologueBackdrop(obj.closeup)`
- `resetUnpackFocus` — restore `RENTAL_UNPACK_SCENE`
- `preloadUnpackCloseups` on rental enter

## Allowed edits

- Tune pad factors in `build-unpack-closeups.py` per item
- Adjust fade CSS on `#prologue-bus-frame.rental-unpack.item-focused`

**Not allowed** without owner asking: new AI close-up art, `buildItemCameraFocus`, bbox auto-zoom on wide scene.

## Deploy

`bash climaticMysteries/scripts/deploy.sh`
